{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_202_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_202","textTraditional":"一、二十有一年，春，王三月，葬蔡平公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_202_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_202","textTraditional":"二、夏，晉侯使士鞅來聘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_202_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_202","textTraditional":"三、宋華亥、向寧、華定自陳入於宋南里以叛。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_202_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_202","textTraditional":"自陳，陳有奉焉爾。入者，內弗受也。其曰宋南里，宋之南鄙也。以者，不以者也。叛，直叛也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_202_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_202","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月，壬午，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_202_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_202","textTraditional":"五、八月，乙亥，叔輒卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_202_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_202","textTraditional":"六、冬，蔡侯東出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_202_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_202","textTraditional":"東者，東國也。何為謂之東也？王父誘而殺焉，父執而用焉，奔而又奔之。曰東，惡之而貶之也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_202_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_202","textTraditional":"七、公如晉，至河乃復。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}